# The osv-scanner release asset CI downloads, and its digest.
#
# Pinned here rather than taken from the release's own checksum file: a checksum
# published beside the artifact it describes proves only that the artifact
# matches itself, so replacing both leaves the check passing. This file is under
# review and version control, which is what makes it evidence.
#
# Bumping the scanner means changing the version in scripts/toolchain.Dockerfile
# and the digest here. CI fails if they disagree with what it downloads.
